text:
Lumen Pay builds checkout and ledger tools for independent shops in Pakistan and the Gulf. Its own site describes two products: Lumen Pay Checkout for card and wallet payments online and in store, and the Lumen Ledger API for developers. In September 2026 it announced a Series A, and its engineering blog describes moving the ledger to PostgreSQL logical replication. The careers page names Sara Malik as the Engineering Manager for Payments.

